{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102131","id":2302827128,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6JQlp4","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102131","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102131.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102131.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102131","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102131/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102131/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102131/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e904c0c014a09548f9058261cd09ddfb8fc2cc24","number":102131,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix memory leak when `ClassDB::bind_method_custom()` fails","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101870\r\n\r\nIn other cases (for example, `ClassDB::_bind_vararg_method()` and `ClassDB::bind_methodfi()`), the method bind is deleted just before returning if it can't be added for some reason.\r\n\r\nA couple examples:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/71d80b26a4c47e1b5e1bab9ed8ef1512e359b5e9/core/object/class_db.cpp#L1899-L1902\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/71d80b26a4c47e1b5e1bab9ed8ef1512e359b5e9/core/object/class_db.cpp#L1949-L1953\r\n\r\nSo, this PR is aiming to do the same thing but in `ClassDB::_bind_method_custom()`.\r\n\r\n(Because I needed to stash `p_method->get_name()` in a variable so I could use it after the method bind is deleted, I also did a tiny refactor to stash that in a local variable for all cases, since it was referred to quite a lot.)","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","number":20,"state":"closed","title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.gith